team:
Of heavy tumbling motions, creaking wheels,
The driver shouting to the lazy team
That swung their rankling bells against her brain;

teasing:
The river's fine, I 'm glad I came,
That poem 's teasing;
But health is better far than fame,

tearing:
Whose growth for them still meant a master's rod;
Tearing her bosom for the wealth that gave
The strength that made the toiler still a slave.

teaches:
Look stedfast truths against Time’s changing mask.
True, many a prophet teaches in the roads;
True, many a seer pulls down the flaming heavens

teaspoon:
Is smiling through at me;
She has her teaspoon in her hand,
Her feeder on for tea.

tearful:
More than a thousand hopes in jubilee;
Dearer the music of one tearful voice
That unforgotten calls and calls to me,

teacher's:
She swallowed her spinach without a squawk;
And patiently listened to Teacher's talk;
She thoughtfully stepped over worms and ants;

teasin:
To lay dis baby boy away;
I'd learned to love his teasin' smile,
He mought o' des been lef' erwhile;

Half asleep across the fiel's;
An' a host o' teasin' fancies
O'er my burnin' senses steals,--

teases:
Stoops to an easy clover --
Dips -- evades -- teases -- deploys;
Then to the royal clouds

tearless:
Plough shattering through my prostrate form.
The tearless sobs tore at my heart.
My host withdrew himself apart;
